OL,3,GNEWSAHow the weather in space can
OL,4,Aaffect us on Earth - and the team
OL,5,Atrying to protect us
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs a result, the Met Office has turned
OL,8,Fto Aberystwyth University researchers
OL,9,Fto help them improve their space
OL,10,Fweather forecasting abilities.
